# CSS

Follow [docs/CSS_ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/CSS_ARCHITECTURE.md). This repo uses
only BEM, SMACSS file roles, and CSS custom properties from that document.
Sheet map and stack limits: [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).
Looks and motion: [docs/DESIGN.md](docs/DESIGN.md).

- BEM: `.block`, `.block__element`, `.block--modifier`. Match existing
  names (`.post__title`, `.site-header__inner`, `.post-banner--fallback`).
- New rules go in the matching sheet under `src/css/`. Add a new sheet only
  if asked; register it in `src/css/style.css`.
- Color, type, space, radius, motion: `var(--token)` from `tokens.css`. Do
  not hardcode a new palette or type size in a component sheet.
- Theme is a token override in `tokens.css`, not per-component color forks.
- Low specificity. No IDs for styling. No `!important`.
- Motion only inside `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)`.
- Never Tailwind, Bootstrap, Sass/Less, CSS-in-JS, or a CSS framework.
